op before you run out of stamina</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports keyboard controls with WASD and arrow keys</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimers:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a work of fiction for entertainment purposes produced and developed by Antifun Bloc. 100% of proceeds go to Antifun Bloc and the development team behind the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains satirical and parodic content referencing public figures and recognizable imagery for commentary and entertainment purposes only.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All third-party materials, names, or likenesses are used transformatively and fall within fair use principles within U.S. law.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No endorsement or affiliation with any third parties including Zohran Mamdani or his campaign is implied.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All assets are original or properly licensed, and the developer will promptly remove or modify any element identified as infringing upon valid third-party rights.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Cait Camelia","Kaif Gilani","Keanan Pucci","Christopher Kovalik Gandhi","Sophie Abromowitz","Anup Kishore","Adriano Valle Hernandez","Patrick So","Kyle Brown-Watson","Sophie Abromowitz","Ryan Lam","Nadia Taylor Riddick","Noah Cutwright","Matthew Hamilton-Roux","Music by CHiPS","Russell Matney","Ashley Chen","Marissa Koors"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072500/c29f4557a93a6a15b1d8f90e4b7b9d01984aca07/header.jpg?t=1762156915","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br>